event: content_block_delta
data: {"delta":{"partial_json":"{\"file_path\": \"/tmp/dev-dispatch-1.md\", \"content\": \"Task: implement \\\"greet, tested\\\" in the subject repository.\\n\\nDeliver:\\n1. `src/greet.py` containing a function `greet(name)` that returns the string\\n   `\\\"Hello, \u003cname\u003e!\\\"` (e.g. `greet(\\\"Ada\\\")` returns `\\\"Hello, Ada!\\\"`).\\n2. `tests/test_greet.py` with unit tests covering:\\n   - a normal name (e.g. \\\"Ada\\\") producing \\\"Hello, Ada!\\\"\\n   - the empty string `\\\"\\\"` as name, producing \\\"Hello, !\\\"\\n3. Confirm `python3 -m unittest discover -s tests` exits 0 (run it yourself before\\n   replying).\\n\\nCommit your work to your own branch before replying. In your reply, state\\nplainly whether all three of the above are true, and note anything unusual you\\nhit.\\n\"}","type":"input_json_delta"},"index":1,"type":"content_block_delta"}

